  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"Serilum 模組。以愛打造。為 Fabric、Forge 與 Neo 提供大量活躍模組！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg&w=400\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg&w=400\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"關於此模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span>《Replanting Crops》是一款輕量模組，會自動使用掉落物中的種子重新種植已收穫的作物。預設情況下必須手持鐮刀才會觸發重新種植，但此設定可在配置檔案中切換。按住蹲下鍵也可阻止重新種植。<br><br>版本 4.0 新增對擴展自 CropBlock 的模組作物支援。</span></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"相依性\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/collective\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg&w=502\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/modpack/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg&w=700\" alt=\"收錄於 The Vanilla Experience\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/serilums-qol-bundle\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/qol-bundle.svg&w=668\" alt=\"收錄於 Serilum 的 QoL 套件\" width=\"334\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg&w=440\" alt=\"環境：伺服器端\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"可設定\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/configuration-guide\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg&w=440\" alt=\"設定指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;所有可用的設定選項：</p>\n<details><summary>顯示詳情</summary>\n<p><span><strong>mustHoldHoeForReplanting</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值：true<br>啟用後，玩家必須手持鐮刀才能自動重新種植作物。<br><br></p>\n<p><span><span><strong>適用於小麥、胡蘿蔔、馬鈴薯、甜菜根、地獄疣、可可豆以及各種模組作物。</strong></span></span></p>\n</details>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/replanting-crops/a.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/replanting-crops/b.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/replanting-crops/c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/replanting-crops/d.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/replanting-crops/e.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/replanting-crops/f.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/replanting-crops/j.png\" alt=\"\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span><strong>一次收割任意數量的作物。掉落物將用於重新種植下方的作物。</strong></span></p>\n<details><summary>顯示詳情</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/replanting-crops/g.webp\" alt=\"動畫 1\" width=\"848\" height=\"476\"></p>\n</details>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><span><br><span><strong>按住蹲下鍵時，作物不會被重新種植。清理農場時相當實用！</strong></span></span></p>\n<details><summary>顯示詳情</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/replanting-crops/h.webp\" alt=\"動畫 2\" width=\"850\" height=\"476\"></p>\n</details>\n<p><br><span><br><span><strong>同樣適用於地獄疣與可可豆：</strong><br></span></span></p>\n<details><summary>顯示詳情</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/replanting-crops/i.webp\" alt=\"動畫 3\" width=\"846\" height=\"392\"></p>\n</details>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"備註與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><strong>只要下載來源仍保留在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生態系統內，您就可以在任何模組包中自由使用此模組。</strong></span><br><br><span><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Serilum.com</a> 提供了所有可用模組的總覽與更多資訊。</span><br><span><br>若有問題、想法、建議或其他任何事項，請至&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\">GitHub 儲存庫</a>。感謝您！</span><span><br><br></span></p>",
